{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2ES5K &quot;Yermak&quot; is a mainline freight electric locomotive operating on 25 kV AC, with four-axle sections equipped with DC traction motors. These locomotives represent the next evolutionary stage in the development of the VL80 freight locomotive family and are positioned as their primary replacement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locomotives were developed in Novocherkassk and have been produced since 2004, being the most widely manufactured family of Russian electric locomotives currently in production. A modified version of the 2ES5K \u2014 the 2EL5 locomotive \u2014 was produced at the Luhansk plant. The majority of 2EL5 units are operated in Ukraine.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3609210?t=1744917854","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609210/5aca3324a14825bb2f6177cae66c65dc49755517/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744917854","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609210/a92663397fb5df204fc43be445aab87c43c8deb9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917854","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3609210/a92663397fb5df204fc43be445aab87c43c8deb9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917854","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2ES5K &quot;Yermak&quot; is a mainline freight electric locomotive operating on 25 kV AC, with four-axle sections equipped with DC traction motors. These locomotives represent the next evolutionary stage in the development of the VL80 freight locomotive family and are positioned as their primary replacement.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The locomotives were developed in Novocherkassk a